, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn8le18ob09re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le18ob09re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le18ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le18ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What a great idea to have our nails done together! We can chat and get manicures at the same time.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes, I needed to talk to you and I thought I had better meet with you in person.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What do you need to talk about? All the gossip had better be shared!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: This isn't gossip! You've spurred me to make a transition in my life too. My life may be transformed by my plan!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That sounds intriguing! Tell me all about it. This is my chance to return the favor."}, {"time": "26000", "image": "engenn8le18ob09re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm going to change the style of the restaurant. I think it might be more lucrative  if it catered to children.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What? Your rationale for doing this has to be explained!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: First, more people are taking their kids out to restaurants.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes, but why does your restaurant have to be converted?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: There aren't many restaurants that make families feel welcome. In fact, a lot of restaurants don't allow children.  In other words, families are discriminated against."}, {"time": "54000", "image": "engenn8le18ob09re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Of course there is a reason that some people don't like children in a restaurant.  For example, sometimes they are really loud and misbehave.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You are right. However, people who have children understand about kids and they wouldn't object. Also, kids go to bed early so I could close the restaurant earlier.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: On the other hand, you'll lose all the customers who don't have kids. Think of the consequences!"}]}}], "_data": [], "id": 1, "type": "audio"}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}